  "title": "MXC Configuration 0.9.0-alpha",
  "description": "Exact mutable MXC development configuration contract.",
  "$comment": "GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT. Regenerate with: cargo run --manifest-path src/Cargo.toml -p mxc_schema_gen -- schema --version 0.9.0-alpha --out schemas/dev/mxc-config.schema.0.9.0-alpha.json. Lifecycle operation and sandbox identity are supplied out of band.",
  "allOf": [
    {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Request"
        },
        {
          "else": true,
          "if": {
            "properties": {
